OL,3,AIvan Toney loses bid to avoid Euro 2028
OL,4,Acourt clash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to move the date of England
OL,7,Fstriker Ivan Toney's assault trial to
OL,8,Favoid a clash with Euro 2028 has been
OL,9,Frefused.
OL,11,FThe 30-year-old footballer, from
OL,12,FNorthampton, is accused of headbutting
OL,13,Fand punching Saber Da Silva during a
OL,14,Fconfrontation at a nightclub in Wardour
OL,15,FStreet, central London, on 6 December.
OL,17,FToney denied assault occasioning actual
OL,18,Fbodily harm at a court hearing last
OL,19,Fmonth and a date for a trial of up to
OL,20,Ffour days was fixed for 12 June 2028,
OL,21,Fwhich is three days into the Uefa Euro
OL,22,F2028 tournament.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
