OL,3,AIvan Toney loses bid to avoid Euro 2028
OL,4,Acourt clash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe represented England at this summer's
OL,7,FWorld Cup and has made 10 international
OL,8,Fappearances. It is not yet known if he
OL,9,Fwill be selected for Euro 2028, but the
OL,10,Fapplication was made in case.
